{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature\/attributes"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A dictionary of attributes for this feature."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copy","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSDictionary<NSString *,id>","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attributes","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can configure an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object to include or exclude a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specific feature in an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". In the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property, compare a key of the attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dictionary to the value you want to include. For example, if you want an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object to display only important features, you might assign"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a value above 50 to the important features’ "},{"code":"importance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute, then set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer\/predicate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/foundation\/nspredicate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"importance > 50","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also configure many layout and paint attributes of an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object to match the value of an attribute in this dictionary whenever it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renders this feature. For example, if you display features in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" using an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCircleStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", you can assign a "},{"code":"halfway","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute to each of the source’s features, then set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCircleStyleLayer\/circleRadius","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to an expression for the key path "},{"code":"halfway","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/text","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/iconImageName","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties allow you to use attributes yet another way. For example, to label"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"features in an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object by their names, you can assign a "},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute to each of the source’s features, then set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/text","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to an expression for the constant string value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"{name}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Predicates and Expressions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guide for more information about expressions."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In vector tiles loaded by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects, the keys and values of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each feature’s attribute dictionary are determined by the source. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute name is a string, while each attribute value may be a null value,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Boolean value, integer, floating-point number, or string. These data types are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mapped to instances of the following Foundation classes:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the tile source"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this dictionary"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Null"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNull"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"boolValue"},{"type":"text","text":" property)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" (use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unsignedLongLongValue"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"longLongValue"},{"type":"text","text":" property)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"number"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" (use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"doubleValue"},{"type":"text","text":" property)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"String"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSString"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When adding a feature to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", use the same Foundation types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listed above for each attribute value. In addition to the Foundation types, you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may also set an attribute to an "},{"code":"NSColor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (macOS) or "},{"code":"UIColor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS), which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be converted into its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CSS string representation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the feature is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". This can be convenient when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the attribute to supply a value for a color-typed layout or paint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute via a key path expression."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that while it is possible to change this value on feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances obtained from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and related"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods, there will be no effect on the map. Setting this value can be useful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the feature instance is used to initialize an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source is added to the map and styled."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnfeature\/attributes"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"module